        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 720/220, Air-Stream Satin Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Retro Styled Stainless Steel Door Pull has a unique oblong shape that will add a charming sci-fi quality to any door. This Air-Stream Stainless Steel Door Pull handle has 8-5/8 inch center to center with a 15 inch overall length. It is made from durable, premium grade stainless steel and comes packaged with either through-bolt mounting or back to back mounting (must purchase 2 pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/15-inch-air-stream-stainless-steel-appliance-pull-omnia-ap-720-220-us32d\"><b>Air-Stream Stainless Steel Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 720/220 Air-Stream Stainless Steel Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-5/8\" Center to Center Hole Spacing</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
